# What `vercel deploy` uploads when this folder is the project root. Without this file the CLI
# falls back to .gitignore, which excludes the generated Wasm package that the build imports
# (src/wasm/pkg, made by `pnpm wasm`). Everything the CLI always skips (node_modules, .git,
# .vercel, .next) stays skipped.

# Secrets and local settings never leave the machine. Production variables live in Vercel.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.vercel
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
